-- amount `s` below the width, `x >> s` is `x / 2^s` (in `Int`); linear
-- arithmetic adds the instance for every `x >> s` atom with a non-literal
-- `s` (`auto::arith`), so `(x >> s) & 1` and `(x / pow2(s)) % 2` meet.
